ink":15},{"localized_name":"音訊","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":16},{"localized_name":"每秒影格數","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"}},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"color_space","name":"color_space","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"color_space"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"影片","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[17]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"},"widgets_values":[24,"auto","sRGB"],"widgets_values_named":{"fps":24,"bit_depth":"auto","color_space":"sRGB"}},{"id":13,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[4120,100],"size":[280,125.859375],"flags":{},"order":13,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":17},{"localized_name":"檔名前綴","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"}},{"localized_name":"格式","name":"format","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format"}},{"localized_name":"format.codec","name":"format.codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"format.codec"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"編碼器","name":"codec","shape":7,"type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"}}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"SaveVideo"},"widgets_values":["h3_ref2va","auto","auto","auto"],"widgets_values_named":{"filename_prefix":"h3_ref2va","format":"auto","format.codec":"auto","codec":"auto"}},{"id":14,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-450,80],"size":[440,928.71875],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"textHeight":340,"textWidth":440},"widgets_values":["## H3 参考图生视频（ref2va）/ Reference-to-Video\n\n**EN:** Generate video using reference images (up to 9) to lock identity/style. The reference latent is injected every sampling step (never denoised). Use `<Picture i>` tags in prompt to reference them.\n\n**中文：** 用参考图片（最多 9 张）生成视频，锁定主体/风格一致性。参考 latent 每步注入不被去噪。提示词用 `<Picture 1>` 标签引用图片。\n\n**使用步骤**：\n1. 当前工作流带 1 个参考图输入（LoadImage → ref_image_0，测试图）\n2. 想多加参考：再添加 LoadImage 节点连到 MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo 的 ref_image_1/2...\n3. prompt 用 `<Picture 1>` 引用，例如：`<Picture 1> 中的主角在霓虹城市跳舞，镜头环绕`\n4. 点 Run 运行\n\n**关键参数**：ref_image_size = match（快）/ max（2048px 保真，慢数倍）；length 58→3秒/124≈5秒；steps 25；cfg=1.0\n\n**注意**：本工作流使用 Ref2VA 模型（MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-Q4_K_S.gguf，已安装）。如需参考视频/音频输入，需扩展节点（LoadVideo/LoadAudio）。\n\n---\n\n## 📦 模型配置清单（Model Setup）\n\n**已安装模型（5 个，共 56GB，均在 ComfyUI/models/ 下）**\n| 文件 | 目录 | 大小 | 用途 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| MiniMax-H3-FL2VA-Q4_K_M.gguf | models/unet/ | 18.5 GB | 文生视频/首尾帧主模型 |\n| MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-Q4_K_S.gguf | models/unet/ | 18.5 GB | 参考模式模型 |\n| qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3-Q4_K_M.gguf | models/text_encoders/ | 13.6 GB | Qwen3-VL-32B 文本编码器 |\n| minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors | models/vae/ | 4.85 GB | 视频解码 VAE |\n| minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors | models/vae/ | 0.56 GB | 音频解码 VAE |\n\n**加载器配置**：UnetLoaderGGUF → 选对应模型；CLIPLoaderGGUF → clip_name=qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3-Q4_K_M.gguf, **type=minimax**；VAELoader → 对应 VAE 文件。\n\n**下载地址**：ModelScope https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Abiray/MiniMax-H3-GGUF（快）/ HF镜像 https://hf-mirror.com/Abiray/MiniMax-H3-GGUF\n"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## H3 参考图生视频（ref2va）/ Reference-to-Video\n\n**EN:** Generate video using reference images (up to 9) to lock identity/style. The reference latent is injected every sampling step (never denoised). Use `<Picture i>` tags in prompt to reference them.\n\n**中文：** 用参考图片（最多 9 张）生成视频，锁定主体/风格一致性。参考 latent 每步注入不被去噪。提示词用 `<Picture 1>` 标签引用图片。\n\n**使用步骤**：\n1. 当前工作流带 1 个参考图输入（LoadImage → ref_image_0，测试图）\n2. 想多加参考：再添加 LoadImage 节点连到 MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo 的 ref_image_1/2...\n3. prompt 用 `<Picture 1>` 引用，例如：`<Picture 1> 中的主角在霓虹城市跳舞，镜头环绕`\n4. 点 Run 运行\n\n**关键参数**：ref_image_size = match（快）/ max（2048px 保真，慢数倍）；length 58→3秒/124≈5秒；steps 25；cfg=1.0\n\n**注意**：本工作流使用 Ref2VA 模型（MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-Q4_K_S.gguf，已安装）。如需参考视频/音频输入，需扩展节点（LoadVideo/LoadAudio）。\n\n---\n\n## 📦 模型配置清单（Model Setup）\n\n**已安装模型（5 个，共 56GB，均在 ComfyUI/models/ 下）**\n| 文件 | 目录 | 大小 | 用途 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| MiniMax-H3-FL2VA-Q4_K_M.gguf | models/unet/ | 18.5 GB | 文生视频/首尾帧主模型 |\n| MiniMax-H3-Ref2VA-Q4_K_S.gguf | models/unet/ | 18.5 GB | 参考模式模型 |\n| qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3-Q4_K_M.gguf | models/text_encoders/ | 13.6 GB | Qwen3-VL-32B 文本编码器 |\n| minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors | models/vae/ | 4.85 GB | 视频解码 VAE |\n| minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors | models/vae/ | 0.56 GB | 音频解码 VAE |\n\n**加载器配置**：UnetLoaderGGUF → 选对应模型；CLIPLoaderGGUF → clip_name=qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3-Q4_K_M.gguf, **type=minimax**；VAELoader → 对应 VAE 文件。\n\n**下载地址**：ModelScope https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Abiray/MiniMax-H3-GGUF（快）/ HF镜像 https://hf-mirror.com/Abiray/MiniMax-H3-GGUF\n"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,2,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[2,4,0,7,0,"CLIP"],[3,5,0,7,1,"VAE"],[4,6,0,7,2,"VAE"],[5,1,0,7,12,"STRING"],[6,4,0,8,0,"CLIP"],[7,3,0,9,0,"MODEL"],[8,7,0,9,1,"CONDITIONING"],[9,8,0,9,2,"CONDITIONING"],[10,7,1,9,3,"LATENT"],[11,9,0,10,0,"LATENT"],[12,5,0,10,1,"VAE"],[13,9,0,11,0,"LATENT"],[14,6,0,11,1,"VAE"],[15,10,0,12,0,"IMAGE"],[16,11,0,12,1,"AUDIO"],[17,12,0,13,0,"VIDEO"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"aaaliceSidebar":{"version":4,"pages":[]},"ds":{"scale":1.4129750793393392,"offset":[-2618.1633431988057,123.76796626838917]}},"version":0.4}